DESCRIPTION:PHONE INTERVIEW WITH Progressive\n\n\nYour Progressive Phone In
 terview is scheduled! We will be calling you at the number listed on your p
 rofile. Reminder that the interview time will be in the time zone of the in
 terviewer.\n\nTo best prepare for the interview\, please have your most rec
 ent resume available as we will be going over your work history in more det
 ail. Also\, we use behavioral-based questions in our interview process. We
  ask that you be ready to share different examples from the ones already pr
 ovided in your video interview. Finally\, please be sure you are in a distr
 action free environment so that you will be at your best for our interview.
   \n\nYou can find additional information to help you prepare by clicking
  here.  ( https://www.progressive.com/careers/how-we-hire/application-next
 -steps/interviewing/ )\n\n  POSITION: Progressive Phone Interview\n  WHEN: 
 Tuesday\, Jul 02 10:30 a.m. - 11:30 a.m. PDT (UTC-0700)\n\nInterviews are 
 in the Pacific Time Zone\n\nSelf-Scheduling\nNeed to make a change to your 
 phone interview schedule?\n\n  Click here to reschedule or decline your pho
 ne interview. ( https://progressive.hirevue.com/interviews/Pk5acny-gev9xs/s
 chedule/ )\n\nBest regards\,\nWilmer Kinnsion(Pacific Time Zone) \nwilmer_e
 _kinnison@progressive.com \n\n\nFor technical support\, please visit the Hi
 reVue Help Center: https://hirevuesupport.zendesk.com\n\n\nPlease do not re
 ply to this message. Replies are routed to an unmonitored mailbox.\n\nInter
 view Code: Pk5acny-gev9xs\n\nPowered by HireVue\n
