DESCRIPTION:Event Name\nFirst Interview w/ Roethlisberger Agency\n\nThank y
 ou for your interest in joining The Roethlisberger Agency! This first conve
 rsation is an opportunity for us to get to know each other better. We’ll 
 discuss your background\, career goals\, and how your skills align with the
  agency’s mission and values.\n\nWhat to Expect:\n\n• A 15 minute conve
 rsation with our hiring team\, this will be held through zoom.\n\n\nPlease
  accept the calendar invite so we know you received it properly!\n\nWe lo
 ok forward to meeting you!\n\n\n-The Roethlisberger Agency\n\nLocation: Thi
 s is a Zoom web conference.\n\nYou can join this meeting from your computer
 \, tablet\, or smartphone.\nhttps://us06web.zoom.us/j/82936411478\n\nOne ta
 p mobile:\n+1 646 931 3860\,\,82936411478#\n+1 929 205 6099\,\,82936411478#
 \n\nYou can also dial in using your phone.\nUS: +1 646 931 3860\, +1 929 20
 5 6099\, +1 301 715 8592\, +1 305 224 1968\, +1 309 205 3325\, +1 312 626 6
 799\, +1 360 209 5623\, +1 386 347 5053\, +1 507 473 4847\, +1 564 217 2000
 \, +1 669 444 9171\, +1 669 900 6833\, +16892781000\, +1 719 359 4580\, +1 
