 \n\nJoin from a video system or application\nsip:82936411478@zoomcrc.com\nY
 ou can also dial and enter your meeting ID 829-364-11478\n\nPhone Number: +
 1 313-466-7426\n\nUSA - Location (State): Texas\n\nDo you hold an active Li
 fe and Health Insurance License? (don't worry\, we will direct you on how t
 o get licensed if you're not yet!): Unlicensed\n\nDid you watch the short (
 3min) overview video that goes over all the details of who we are\, what we
  do and how we do it?: Yes\n\nThis is a 1099\, commission + bonus position.
  Does that resonate with what you're looking for?: Yes\n\nWhy does this opp
 ortunity interest you?: Want to return to an industry that more closer reso
 nates with me\, the agency seems marketable from the outside in and it give
