SUMMARY:Interview with National Debt Relief LLC for Inside Sales Representa
 tive Position
DESCRIPTION:~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nInterview with National Debt Relief LLC for Inside Sales
  Representative Position\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n[[ Required Attendees ]]\nMorgan Naranjo
  <MorganAmbrose@proton.me>\n\nHello Morgan\,\n\n\nThank you for taking the 
 time to learn more about National Debt Relief and the Inside Sales Represen
 tative position. We're excited to get to know more about your experience an
 d have lined up the next steps of the interview process for you. \n\n\nYou 
 will be meeting with Clyde Owusu from the Sales team. Please join 5 minutes
  early.\n\n\nTime: Thursday\, July 30th at 10:00 AM CST (11:00 AM EST for r
 eference)\nTeams Video Meeting: \n\nhttps://teams.microsoft.com/meet/215331
 526775809?p=EchMwMxgTxh5FtxSWf<https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/21533152677
 5809?p=EchMwMxgTxh5FtxSWf>\n\nMeeting ID: 215 331 526 775 809\nPasscode: 92
 2df3uM \n\n\n\nPlease confirm your acceptance. Please see below for quick t
 ips to help you prepare for your virtual interview. We look forward to hear
 ing from you! \n\n\nVirtual Interview Tips\n\n\nTechnical Setup\n- We’re 
 using Microsoft Teams for your video interview. You can join via the web\, 
 no download required.\n- We recommend joining from a laptop or desktop for 
 the best audio\, video and connection quality.\n- Test your background appe
 arance (neutral\, uncluttered\, and well-lit). \n- Join the meeting 5 minut
 es early to allow time to resolve any technical issues.\nContent Preparatio
 n\n- Research about National Debt Relief and the role (review the job descr
 iption). \n- Prepare to have specifics when asked situational or behavioral
  questions.   \n- Tip: Prepare STAR Method Responses (Situation\, Task\, Ac
 tion\, Result).\n\n- Prepare questions to ask the interviewer. \nInterview 
 Day\n- Dress code is business casual. Think neat and organized\, like a pol
 o or blouse. Business professional is fine with us too. We just recommend a
 voiding overly casual items such as hoodies or hats during the interview pr
 ocess.\n- Maintain good posture\, eye contact\, and enthusiasm throughout t
 he interview.\n- Eliminate distractions such as silencing your phone/apps.\
 n\n\nThank you\, \n\n\nGiovanna Cuesta \nGiovanna.Cuesta@nationaldebtrelief
 .com \nNational Debt Relief
